  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Dame Emma Natasha Walmsley  (born June 1969) is a British business executive, who was the chief executive of GSK (formerly GlaxoSmithKline) from April 2017 until 31 December 2025. Before GSK, she worked for L'Oréal for 17 years, and was a non-executive director of Diageo until September 2016. Walmsley is also a non-executive director of Microsoft. She is due to become chief executive of HP Inc. on 4 January 2027.",
    "sourceId": "wikipedia-en",
    "usage": "Research excerpt; paraphrase and cross-check before publication."
  },
